\f1\fs22 Below is a clean replacement specification for the scene. It assumes the entombment chapter is already fixed and discards the earlier Sarah-treatment notes rather than modifying them.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 Canonical scene specification \'97 Janine, Pin Cushion, and the zipper\
1. Narrative job\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 This scene reveals the missing half of Janine Anstey\'92s story.\
The reader has already seen Janine dead beneath the Pale. The reader has already seen that, during entombment, the physical TPlus stock was consumed and Janine deliberately removed the surviving documentary trail of the TPlus programme. The reader also knows adult Sarah and has already encountered TPlus operating in the present-day narrative.\
What the reader does 
\f2\b not
\f1\b0  yet know is that these histories intersect.\
This scene must reveal that before Janine was entombed:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}her daughter suffered from LGMD;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Janine secretly removed concentrated TPlus material from the Pale;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}she identified a weakness in Hermann\'92s assumptions about permanent integration;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}she treated her daughter covertly;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}the treatment repaired the LGMD;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Janine obtained convincing evidence that TPlus had become incorporated permanently rather than merely producing a temporary therapeutic effect;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}this is the origin of the missing stock and records that mattered so much to Janine later;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Janine believes the treatment may give her daughter an extraordinarily long healthy life;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Janine promises to explain the implications properly when she gets home from work;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}she leaves for the Pale;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}her daughter continues riding an exercise bike with effortless strength;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}only at the end does the reader learn that the daughter is 
\f2\b Sarah
\f1\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 The scene should cause existing parts of the novel to snap together rather than introduce a new storyline.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 2. Narrative position\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Chronologically, this happens before the entombment.\
Narratively, it happens after it.\
That means every domestic action involving Janine carries information she does not possess but the reader does:\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 she is going to work and will not come home.
\f1\b0 \
The narrator must not point this out.\
No:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}last breakfast;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}final embrace;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}last time she saw her;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}ominous hesitation at the door;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}prophetic thoughts;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}retrospective lamentation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Janine thinks she is going to work.\
Her daughter thinks her mother will return.\
The reader does the rest.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 3. Identity concealment\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Janine\'92s patient is openly her daughter.\
The concealment is only her 
\f2\b name
\f1\b0 .\
This should not feel like a narrator conspicuously refusing to identify somebody. The mother and daughter already possess a private nickname that makes the withholding natural:\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 Pin Cushion.
\f1\b0 \
Janine can therefore address her daughter directly throughout the scene without once needing to use her legal name.\
The nickname belongs to their shared history of illness and treatment.\
It should feel old.\
It predates TPlus.\
It probably originated during years of:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}blood tests;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}biopsies;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}injections;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}hospital appointments;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}cannulas;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}diagnostic procedures;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}repeated medical handling.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Most importantly, 
\f2\b the daughter owns the joke
\f1\b0 .\
She either invented \'93Pin Cushion\'94 herself or adopted it so completely that Janine now uses it as an affectionate title.\
It is not Janine making light of her daughter\'92s suffering.\
It represents the daughter refusing to let medical treatment own the meaning of what has happened to her.\
Their use of it can be irreverent, affectionate and occasionally ceremonial.\
Something unpleasant happened often enough that they gave it a ridiculous name and made the name theirs.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 4. Pin Cushion as personal history\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 The nickname should do more than disguise \'93Sarah\'94.\
It gives the relationship history before the scene begins.\
There may be established rituals around treatment:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Pin Cushion announcing how many holes she has acquired;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}demanding compensation after needles;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Janine referring to her as \'93Her Perforated Highness\'94 or some similarly occasional extension if that suits the actual dialogue;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}a joke about needing a cork;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}the daughter keeping score;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}an old rule about what happens after a particularly bad procedure.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 These are 
\f2\b possibilities of function
\f1\b0 , not required jokes. The draft should invent only what naturally fits.\
The important thing is that their black humour has been forged by repeated treatment.\
That makes \'93Pin Cushion\'94 affectionate precisely because the history underneath it is not.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 5. The daughter\'92s LGMD at scene opening\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 The disease must be physically real before the cure becomes visible.\
Avoid a medical-summary paragraph.\
Show Janine noticing movements she has watched deteriorate over time.\
The impairment is proximal: hips, thighs, shoulders and the large muscle groups required for ordinary transitions and sustained movement.\
Useful manifestations include:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}pushing off furniture to rise;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}using arms to compensate when getting up;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}stairs requiring deliberate effort;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}inability to run properly;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}fatigue appearing first in the thighs and hips;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}difficulty maintaining exercise resistance;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}compensatory hip movement once tired.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Use only enough to make the change measurable.\
Janine does not need to think:\
This is characteristic proximal weakness associated with limb-girdle muscular dystrophy.\
She knows what her daughter looks like getting out of a chair.\
That is better.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 6. The exercise bike must exist from the beginning\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 The bike is not brought onstage for the triumphant ending.\
It is already part of Pin Cushion\'92s life.\
It may have been prescribed or acquired as part of maintaining mobility and muscle function.\
At the beginning of this historical sequence, riding it is work.\
Establish a recognisable baseline.\
For example:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}low resistance;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}short periods;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}cadence deteriorating;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Janine watching the hips compensate;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}the daughter resenting how quickly her legs tire;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}needing a rest after an amount of exercise she considers insulting;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}perhaps wanting a real bicycle but being unable to manage one safely or for useful distance.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 The emotional purpose is simple:\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 the bike initially measures what LGMD has taken from her.
\f1\b0 \
At the end it measures what has returned.\
\

\f2\b 7. The real-bike aspiration\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 A desire for a real bicycle is worth retaining.\
It gives the exercise bike an emotional dimension beyond medical testing.\
Pin Cushion does not want better numbers.\
She wants to ride somewhere.\
The aspiration can be very ordinary:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}a park;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}a particular path;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}somewhere she sees other children riding;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}simply outdoors instead of pedalling without going anywhere.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Do not over-symbolise the bicycle as \'93freedom\'94.\
If she wants a proper bike because stationary bikes are boring, that is enough.\
By the closing sequence she can already be talking as though the real bicycle is now inevitable.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 8. Janine\'92s scientific starting point\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Janine understands Hermann\'92s model from inside the programme.\
Hermann believes TPlus ordinarily remains outside the chromosomes. He has already told Jansen that permanent incorporation would require an extraordinary coincidence involving damaged DNA, local vector availability and repair activity, while sufficiently high exposure should produce lethal systemic toxicity before useful stable integration could occur.\
Janine sees the weakness:\
Hermann is reasoning from the behaviour of 
\f2\b ordinary tissue under systemic exposure
\f1\b0 .\
Her daughter does not have ordinary muscle.\
The disease itself creates the unusual biological environment Hermann treats as statistically negligible.\
Janine does not discover a completely unrelated mechanism.\
She exploits the exception Hermann himself has acknowledged and then dismissed.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 9. The zipper\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 The zipper is 
\f2\b not narrator biology
\f1\b0 .\
It is Pin Cushion\'92s model.\
At some earlier point Janine has tried to explain what is going wrong inside her muscles and what she is attempting to do.\
The daughter has turned this into a zipper.\
The exact origin can emerge naturally.\
Perhaps Janine explained damaged DNA and repair badly.\
Perhaps Pin Cushion concluded:\
So the zipper\'92s broken.\
Janine then tried to qualify it scientifically.\
Pin Cushion ignored her.\
From that point onward the zipper belongs to them.\
It becomes useful language for frightening procedures:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}broken teeth in the zipper;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}putting something useful near the break;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}getting the body to catch the new piece;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}asking whether the zipper has taken;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}asking whether it can come undone again.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 The metaphor does not need to be accurate enough for a journal article.\
It needs to be accurate enough for a frightened young person who has had too many needles.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 10. Why the zipper matters structurally\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 The zipper gives the chapter three levels of language.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 Hermann\'92s language:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 episomal vectors, illegitimate recombination, double-strand breaks, toxic thresholds.\

\f2\b Janine\'92s language:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 the actual experimental mechanism she is attempting to exploit.\

\f2\b Pin Cushion\'92s language:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 the zipper.\
The scene should move freely between the last two.\
When Janine eventually sees convincing molecular evidence of integration, she can understand it in full technical detail and simultaneously recognise the private translation:\

\f2\b the zipper held.
\f1\b0 \
If that formulation is used, use it once.\
Do not turn the zipper into a recurring authorial motif every few paragraphs.\
\

\f2\b 11. The stolen TPlus\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Janine obtains concentrated experimental TPlus from the Pale.\
She is not making a homemade cure.\
She is diverting actual programme material to an unauthorised patient.\
The stock is specialised enough for local high-dose experimental use.\
That matters because Janine\'92s strategy depends upon achieving a concentration at the damaged tissue that differs fundamentally from a normal therapeutic administration.\
Her theft leaves a bookkeeping problem.\
Not necessarily a giant obvious hole.\
But material that should be somewhere is not where the records say it ought to be.\
That discrepancy later becomes dangerous enough that the entombed Janine knows which records must disappear.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 12. Janine\'92s offence\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 The scene must not sanitise what she is doing.\
Janine is:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}stealing experimental material;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}treating her own child;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}bypassing the programme;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}bypassing conventional clinical oversight;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}deliberately exceeding assumptions built into the safe therapeutic model;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}betting that local delivery will evade a toxicity Hermann believes should make the experiment impossible.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Her daughter\'92s illness makes the choice understandable.\
It does not make it professionally orthodox.\
Janine knows that.\
The daughter may know much less about the institutional dimensions but understands that this is something Mum is not supposed to be doing.\
That can become part of their shared secrecy without turning the child into Janine\'92s conspiratorial research partner.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 13. Pin Cushion has agency\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 She is not a passive sick child while Janine performs science on her.\
She has endured enough medicine to have opinions.\
She can:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}hate particular needles;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}demand explanations;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}negotiate;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}refuse to look;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}insist on looking;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}make jokes Janine finds appalling;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}ask what could go wrong;\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}decide she wants to proceed.\
