\f2\b \cf2 14. First treatment\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 The procedure is domestic and uncomfortable.\
Avoid laboratory grandeur.\
Needle.\
Affected muscle.\
Careful preparation.\
Janine monitoring far too many things at once because she knows precisely what Hermann predicts might happen.\
The immediate risk is real.\
Janine watches for systemic catastrophe.\
Nothing catastrophic happens.\
That is the first victory.\
It is not proof of permanent integration.\
Pin Cushion survives the dose.\
Janine learns that local concentration can apparently cross a boundary Hermann regarded as practically unusable without producing the predicted whole-body disaster.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 15. The course of treatment\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 There are repeated treatments.\
