Do not attach them to Hermann\'92s fourteen-to-twenty-one-day claim.\
Janine adjusts what she does according to:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}tissue response;\
