\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf2 16. What ordinary TPlus improvement cannot prove\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Janine must remain scientifically cautious about the early recovery.\
